              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi Herode bgāca amubashikiriza, mur’ iryo joro Petero yar’ asinziriye hagati y’abasoda babiri, aboheshejwe iminyororo ibiri, abateramyi bāri ku rugi barinda inzu y’ibohero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.5.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 5:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umumarayika w’Umwami Imana amuhagarara i ruhande, umuco ubonesha mu nzu. Akoma Petero mu mbavu, aramukangura, ati Vyuka n’ingoga. Iminyororo imuva ku maboko, irakoroka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umumarayika aramubarira, ati Kenyera, wambare inkweto zawe. Abigenza artyo. Kand’ aramubarira, at’ Ikubirek’ umutamana wawe, unkurikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arasohoka, aramukurikira, yamara ntiyamenya ivyo umumarayika akoze kw ar’ ivy’ ukuri, arikw agira ngw abonye ivyo yeretswe nko mu nzozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baciye ku bateramyi ba mbere no ku ba kabiri, bashika kw irembo ryugarije urugi rw’icuma, rija mu gisagara. Rurabīyugururira ubgarwo, barenga irembo baca mu nzira imwe, uwo mwanya umumarayika aca amusiga hano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akenge kagarutse, Petero aribgira, ati Noneho mmenye vy’ukuri yuk’ Umwami yatumye umumarayika wiwe, akankiza ukuboko kwa Herode, bo n’ivyo ubgoko bg’Abayuda bgāri bushamāje vyose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
